WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.403 --> 00:00:11.768
Decode the Voyager Golden Record, step by step.

2
00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:21.346
Speed, the hydrogen clock and the pulsar map.

3
00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:31.256
Calibrate, then watch the image appear line by line.

4
